WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.500
[Opening Theme] - DramaShort

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.800
Wait! You can't just walk away after what happened.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.000
Everything you were told about that night was a lie.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.800
Then tell me the truth. Who sent you here?

5
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.500
If I tell you, neither of us will walk out of here alive.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Stay right where you are. We're not finished yet.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
[Dramatic Stinger] - To be continued...
